  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "ONLY ONE BLOCK OFF THE BEACH WITH NEW ACCESS ACROSS FROM STINKY'S FISH CAMP. This adorable beach villa on the west end of Scenic Highway 30-A is an ideal retreat for those looking for a wonderful lot with fenced back yard and rooms for outdoor BBQ. This home was completely remodeled in 2019 and offers 2 full bedrooms, 2 full bathrooms, open living/kitchen/dining, laundry room, screened porch in front and back of home as well as a 2 car garage space. The opportunities are endless for this one but there is nothing that has to be done for you to come and enjoy it just how it is for years to come. Only 1 mile to Gulf Place/Shunk Gulley, Stinky's Fish Camp just one block away and Santa Rosa Golf and Beach Club is just one mile too! Minimum Stay 3 night.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
